<title>GREECE: MIHALARIAS ART, OTE TO AUCTION PHONE CARDS.</title>
<headline>MIHALARIAS ART, OTE TO AUCTION PHONE CARDS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom and Stavros Mihalarias Art will auction 2,169 OTE phone cards issued in 1994 depicting 32 subjects that have become collection items, OTE said.</p>
<p>The auction will take place Sunday June 29 at the amhitheater of OTE's training centre and proceeds will be donated the Imbrian Union of Macedonia-Thrace.</p>
<p>The starting price will be 1,250 per phone card. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
